{"metadata":{"externalID":"c:objc(cs)MLNSymbolStyleLayer(py)textVariableAnchor","fragments":[{"text":"textVariableAnchor","kind":"identifier"}],"roleHeading":"Instance Property","modules":[{"name":"MapLibre"}],"role":"symbol","title":"textVariableAnchor","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"textVariableAnchor","kind":"identifier"}],"symbolKind":"property"},"abstract":[{"text":"To increase the chance of placing high-priority labels on the map, you can","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"provide an array of ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"textAnchor"},{"text":" locations: the renderer will attempt to place","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the label at each location, in order, before moving onto the next label. Use"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"textJustify: auto"},{"text":" to choose justification based on anchor position. To apply","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"an offset, use the ","type":"text"},{"code":"textRadialOffset","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" or the two-dimensional ","type":"text"},{"code":"textOffset","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnsymbolstylelayer\/textvariableanchor"]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNSymbolStyleLayer\/textVariableAnchor","interfaceLanguage":"occ"},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre","doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNSymbolStyleLayer"]]},"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["occ"],"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"],"tokens":[{"text":"@property","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" (","kind":"text"},{"text":"nonatomic","kind":"keyword"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"NSExpression","kind":"typeIdentifi